        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 11:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mambo higa gahendeka ili gahukanye sisi, naswi husiaze kuhenda mai dza akare ehu arivyohenda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 32:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wala husiabudu vizuka dza anjina arivyohenda. Kama Maandiko gaambavyo, “Atu asagala achirya na achinwa, chisha achiunuka achivwina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9+NUM.25.10+NUM.25.11+NUM.25.12+NUM.25.13+NUM.25.14+NUM.25.15+NUM.25.16+NUM.25.17+NUM.25.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 25:1–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahusihende udiya dza akare ehu anjina arivyokala, na achifwa atu elufu mirongo miiri na tahu siku mwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.5+NUM.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 21:5–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala husimjeze Mlungu dza akare ehu anjina arivyohenda, nao achiolagbwa ni nyoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.41+NUM.16.42+NUM.16.43+NUM.16.44+NUM.16.45+NUM.16.46+NUM.16.47+NUM.16.48+NUM.16.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 16:41–49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona husinungʼunike dza arivyonungʼunika, nao achiolagbwa ni malaika wa chifo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mambo higo gaaphaha atu hinyo ili gakale mifwano kpwehu, nago gaandikpwa ili gahukanye swiswi ambao hunaishi siku za mwisho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mchidziona muimire sawa-sawa kpwa Mlungu, mdzimanyirire sedze mukagbwa dambini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takuna majaribu gogosi munagophaha isiphokala garatu ga kawaida ambago anadamu ayawenu nkuphaha. Naye Mlungu ni muaminifu, kandaruhusu mphahe majaribu ga kutsapa uwezo wenu. Ela mchijezwa, Mlungu andakuphani nguvu za kuvumirira ili mgavuke salama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo enehu amendzwa, msiabudu vizuka hata chidide! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi nagomba namwi dza atu ario na ikima, phahi gapimeni enye higa nigombago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.26+MAT.26.27+MAT.26.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 26:26–28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.22+MRK.14.23+MRK.14.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 14:22–24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.19+LUK.22.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 22:19–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hunaphonwa kula chikombe cha baraka cha meza ya Bwana hunachochihumira kpwa kumshukuru Mlungu, kpwa kpweli hunashiriki mlatso wa Jesu phamwenga. Na hunaphomega na kurya mkpwahe wa meza ya Bwana, hunashiriki mwiri wa Jesu phamwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hata dzagbwe hu anji, hunakala mwiri mmwenga kpwa kushiriki kurya mkpwahe mmwenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
